From 5b0156cc3c5cdf8278a898b550651fcd56911276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent <agent@torrent>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:03:19 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: continue a Claude chat on a limit-fallback profile

A profile with limitFallback: true (extending its base provider) is used
while the base is at a usage limit: the limit callout offers to move the
chat there in place and continue; new chats start there; chats move back
when the limit resets. Auto-resume after a limit is on unless a chat opts out.
